    "name":  "Aluminium Profile P5615 - Plaster-in Trimless 56x15mm - 2m - Straight or Bendable",
    "reference":  "P5615",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlaster-in (trimless) aluminium profile\u003c/strong\u003e for LED strips, 56 x 15 mm, with perforated wings that disappear under the plaster.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTwo versions: \u003cstrong\u003estraight\u003c/strong\u003e with opal PC diffuser, or \u003cstrong\u003epre-cut bendable\u003c/strong\u003e with silicone diffuser for curves. Each set: 2 m profile + 2 m diffuser + 4 end caps.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eAluminium Profile P5615 - Plaster-in Trimless 56x15mm - 2m - Straight or Bendable\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eRecessed plaster-in profile with perforated wings. The bendable version is pre-cut so it can follow curved ceilings and walls, and uses a flexible silicone diffuser.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eTechnical data\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMaterial\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eAluminium + PC or silicone diffuser\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eProfile size (W x H)\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e56 x 15mm\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eLength\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2m\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSet contents\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2m aluminium profile, 2m diffuser (PC for straight, silicone for bendable), 4 end caps\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eInstallation\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePlaster-in / trimless installation - bendable version for curves\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e",
